Package: fortigate-cli
Architecture: any
Depends: ${misc:Depends}
Provides: fgt
Description: Unofficial remote CLI for FortiGate/FortiOS (command: fgt)
 fgt is an unofficial, remote-first command-line client for the FortiGate /
 FortiOS REST API (/api/v2/). It talks to the appliance over HTTPS only;
 nothing is installed on the device. cmdb paths configure, monitor paths
 report status.
 .
 Not affiliated with or endorsed by Fortinet, Inc.
